---
// NOTE: General-purpose policy drafted for the marketing website. Have it reviewed by counsel before relying on it.
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SITE, appLinks } from '../data/site';
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" description="How DeployFleet collects, uses and protects information on its website." path="/privacy/" updated="November 3, 2026">
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how DeployFleet (“DeployFleet”, “we”, “us”) collects, uses, and shares information when you visit this website. Use of the DeployFleet platform at <a href={appLinks.login}>deployfleet.com</a> is also governed by the terms and policies presented in the app.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you use our contact form or email us, we collect what you provide, such as your name, email, phone number, company, and message.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage information.</strong> When analytics is enabled, we collect information about how you use the site, such as pages viewed, approximate location, device and browser type, and referring pages. This is collected using cookies and similar technologies.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your questions and requests.</li>
    <li>To understand how the site is used and improve it.</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure and prevent abuse.</li>
    <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we share information</h2>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We share information only with service providers that help us run the site, such as our website host, email provider, and analytics provider (PostHog), and only as needed to provide their services; or when required by law.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>Analytics cookies help us understand site usage. You can block or delete cookies and site data in your browser settings to opt out of analytics.</p>

  <h2>Data retention</h2>
  <p>We keep contact form messages and related correspondence for as long as needed to respond and for reasonable business records, and analytics data according to our analytics provider’s retention settings.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, or obtain a copy of your personal information, and to opt out of certain processing. To make a request, email us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is intended for businesses and professionals and is not directed to children under 16. We do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date above shows when it last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
